[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l017","ordinal":156417,"en":"And return this way!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l018","ordinal":156418,"en":"Let us take the maiden with mutual honor"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l019","ordinal":156419,"en":"And depart without resentment."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l020","ordinal":156420,"en":"Let us go to their envoys;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l021","ordinal":156421,"en":"If they will give Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l022","ordinal":156422,"en":"Let us take their promise;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l023","ordinal":156423,"en":"If they will not give Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l024","ordinal":156424,"en":"Then let us begin the battle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l025","ordinal":156425,"en":"Look carefully, warrior Toltoy:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l026","ordinal":156426,"en":"Livestock has come as tribute,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l027","ordinal":156427,"en":"The khan has come leading them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l028","ordinal":156428,"en":"Grievous force has come upon Afghanistan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l029","ordinal":156429,"en":"All their nobles have come."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l030","ordinal":156430,"en":"Let us hear the envoys' answer,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l031","ordinal":156431,"en":"And then ride out to war!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l032","ordinal":156432,"en":"When mighty Kozho waved"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l033","ordinal":156433,"en":"The red banner mottled gray and white,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l034","ordinal":156434,"en":"It was the signal to dismount;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l035","ordinal":156435,"en":"All the Zhediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l036","ordinal":156436,"en":"Boiled down from their horses."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l037","ordinal":156437,"en":"Swarming like ants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l038","ordinal":156438,"en":"They spread out and dismounted."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b003:l039","ordinal":156439,"en":"Dividing into groups of ten and five,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l001","ordinal":156440,"en":"They gathered around the field cauldrons."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l002","ordinal":156441,"en":"Chynkozho and warrior Tölök"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l003","ordinal":156442,"en":"Had the Zhediger dismount."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l004","ordinal":156443,"en":"Hurrying between the sides came"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l005","ordinal":156444,"en":"Azhybay, son of Azhy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l006","ordinal":156445,"en":"And Tümönbay, son of Tülkü."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l007","ordinal":156446,"en":"Azhybay, son of Azhy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l008","ordinal":156447,"en":"Was a surpassingly eloquent servant,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l009","ordinal":156448,"en":"Swift-tongued and skilled in argument,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l010","ordinal":156449,"en":"A man of exceptional eloquence."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l011","ordinal":156450,"en":"Tümönbay, son of Tülkü,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l012","ordinal":156451,"en":"Proud-hearted and blustering,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l013","ordinal":156452,"en":"Very courageous and stern,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l014","ordinal":156453,"en":"Was a ruthless hero"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l015","ordinal":156454,"en":"Who never turned back from death."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l016","ordinal":156455,"en":"After seeing Kozho and Tölök"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l017","ordinal":156456,"en":"Coming toward them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l018","ordinal":156457,"en":"They had their thoroughbreds prepared"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l019","ordinal":156458,"en":"And the horses tethered far away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l020","ordinal":156459,"en":"They spread foods of every sweet and fine kind"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l021","ordinal":156460,"en":"In abundance before Kozho,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l022","ordinal":156461,"en":"And beneath him had a thick layer"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l023","ordinal":156462,"en":"Of splendid carpets of every kind laid."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l024","ordinal":156463,"en":"Tölök and Chynkozho"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l025","ordinal":156464,"en":"Halted the Zhediger host"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l026","ordinal":156465,"en":"And the two now came between the sides."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l027","ordinal":156466,"en":"When he saw the appearance"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l028","ordinal":156467,"en":"Of Tümönbay and Azhybay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l029","ordinal":156468,"en":"Could Kozho stand without surging forward?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l030","ordinal":156469,"en":"\"Azhybay and Tümönbay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l031","ordinal":156470,"en":"Tell the lawful and unlawful truth."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l032","ordinal":156471,"en":"If you will not give her, name your danger;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l033","ordinal":156472,"en":"If you say you will, state your answer!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l034","ordinal":156473,"en":"If you say you will not give Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l035","ordinal":156474,"en":"Let us begin the turmoil;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l036","ordinal":156475,"en":"Let us send the armies over you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l037","ordinal":156476,"en":"And set your bitter sorrows boiling."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l038","ordinal":156477,"en":"Tell me the purpose for which you girded your waist;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1052:b004:l039","ordinal":156478,"en":"Tell me the place where you lie fortified,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l001","ordinal":156479,"en":"Tell me the man you girded to your waist!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l002","ordinal":156480,"en":"Azhybay, son of Azhy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l003","ordinal":156481,"en":"You spoke idly;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l004","ordinal":156482,"en":"Saying, 'I shall give Aychürök,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l005","ordinal":156483,"en":"You have deceived us for five months."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l006","ordinal":156484,"en":"After seeing your false oath and lies,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l007","ordinal":156485,"en":"I resolved to inflict a spectacle;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l008","ordinal":156486,"en":"Do you see that I drove out"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l009","ordinal":156487,"en":"My dense black army?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l010","ordinal":156488,"en":"If you love splendid quarrels and strife,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l011","ordinal":156489,"en":"Do not hold back, my Azhy;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l012","ordinal":156490,"en":"If you will not give Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l013","ordinal":156491,"en":"Prepare the host with which you will contend."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l014","ordinal":156492,"en":"Fighting with you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l015","ordinal":156493,"en":"We barely escaped death;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l016","ordinal":156494,"en":"Because of what happened before,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l017","ordinal":156495,"en":"Because of Aychürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l018","ordinal":156496,"en":"We narrowly escaped death."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l019","ordinal":156497,"en":"Firing guns and drawing bows,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l020","ordinal":156498,"en":"We fought with cracking volleys."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l021","ordinal":156499,"en":"For the lone maiden Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l022","ordinal":156500,"en":"A band of heroes died on your side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l023","ordinal":156501,"en":"And a band of heroes died on mine."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l024","ordinal":156502,"en":"Listen closely to my words, Azhy!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l025","ordinal":156503,"en":"Until the pliant stalks ripen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l026","ordinal":156504,"en":"Until the law's ashes fly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l027","ordinal":156505,"en":"If we barely escape death"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l028","ordinal":156506,"en":"After fighting hard for six months,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l029","ordinal":156507,"en":"Does one prosper by loving strife?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l030","ordinal":156508,"en":"Will this bring us any benefit?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l031","ordinal":156509,"en":"As Kozho stood surging with fury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l032","ordinal":156510,"en":"Tümönbay, son of Tülkü,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l033","ordinal":156511,"en":"Proved a man of stern temperament."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l034","ordinal":156512,"en":"Azhybay, son of Azhy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l035","ordinal":156513,"en":"Was a hero of surpassing eloquence;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l036","ordinal":156514,"en":"Speaking softly but casting weighty words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l037","ordinal":156515,"en":"Azhybay, son of Azhy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l038","ordinal":156516,"en":"Began to address Chynkozho:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b003:l039","ordinal":156517,"en":"\"If you advance, here is the steppe road;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l001","ordinal":156518,"en":"If you overrun us, here are the Afghan people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l002","ordinal":156519,"en":"If you dig deep, here is the pit;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l003","ordinal":156520,"en":"If you would boil misery, here is the bitterness."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l004","ordinal":156521,"en":"Warrior Kozho, hear my words;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l005","ordinal":156522,"en":"God knows, and you decide."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l006","ordinal":156523,"en":"Take notice of poor men like us,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l007","ordinal":156524,"en":"My precious Kozho, rather than slaughtering us"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l008","ordinal":156525,"en":"For the sake of a maiden."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l009","ordinal":156526,"en":"Do not begin a wondrous conflict;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l010","ordinal":156527,"en":"Saying, 'He will not give Aychürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l011","ordinal":156528,"en":"He will not accept what I say,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l012","ordinal":156529,"en":"Do not reduce palm-sized Afghanistan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l013","ordinal":156530,"en":"To slaughter!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l014","ordinal":156531,"en":"There is much sorrow in the breast,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l015","ordinal":156532,"en":"Blustering Chynkozho;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l016","ordinal":156533,"en":"God stands witness to these words!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l017","ordinal":156534,"en":"Take care, Chynkozho:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l018","ordinal":156535,"en":"I have no reason to begrudge my daughter."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l019","ordinal":156536,"en":"You did not come as an in-law driving livestock,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l020","ordinal":156537,"en":"Bowing in submission and chewing fat;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l021","ordinal":156538,"en":"You did not depart after speaking kindly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l022","ordinal":156539,"en":"Nor offer tea before us."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l023","ordinal":156540,"en":"Saying, 'I shall take Aychürök,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l024","ordinal":156541,"en":"You offered no colt for slaughter."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l025","ordinal":156542,"en":"You gave no kindly words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l026","ordinal":156543,"en":"Warrior, saying, 'He spoke badly,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l027","ordinal":156544,"en":"You say,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l028","ordinal":156545,"en":"You have no grounds to bluster."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l029","ordinal":156546,"en":"You made me taste humiliation,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l030","ordinal":156547,"en":"And after scorning my hospitality,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l031","ordinal":156548,"en":"You thought to take through contempt"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l032","ordinal":156549,"en":"My daughter Aychürök."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l033","ordinal":156550,"en":"Do not take offense at that maiden"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l034","ordinal":156551,"en":"And vent your wrath."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l035","ordinal":156552,"en":"Saying, 'He will not give Aychürök,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l036","ordinal":156553,"en":"Do not flatten my city!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l037","ordinal":156554,"en":"It is also true that I did not accept"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l038","ordinal":156555,"en":"Your pledged words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1053:b004:l039","ordinal":156556,"en":"After you lied so many times"}]
